This project ports ideas and published algorithms from the following works.
No GPL/LGPL source code is copied; only ideas and format constants are used.

- PixelOE (KohakuBlueleaf/PixelOE), Apache-2.0: contrast-aware outline expansion and contrast downsampling (src/convert/outline-expand.ts, src/convert/resample.ts "contrast").
- pixel-sprite-generator (zfedoran/pixel-sprite-generator), MIT: Dave Bollinger sprite algorithm and mask presets (src/gen/bollinger.ts, src/gen/masks.ts).
- OKLab color space, Bjorn Ottosson (public domain matrices).

Third-party runtime dependencies:
- fast-png@8.0.0 (MIT)
- zod@4.6.5 (MIT)
- @modelcontextprotocol/sdk@1.31.0 (MIT)
- opentype.js@2.0.0 (MIT)
